{"duration": 36.87, "segs": [{"id": "hook", "start": 0.35, "end": 2.83, "text": "Ta vidéo a trois secondes pour survivre."}, {"id": "algo", "start": 2.89, "end": 8.91, "text": "Après, l'algorithme regarde une seule chose : est-ce que les gens restent, ou est-ce qu'ils swipent ?"}, {"id": "debut", "start": 8.926, "end": 14.67, "text": "Pour qu'ils restent, ouvre fort : montre le résultat, pose une question, ou contredis une idée reçue."}, {"id": "jamais", "start": 14.803, "end": 20.11, "text": "Et surtout, jamais de « Salut, aujourd'hui je vais vous parler de… ». On a déjà swipé."}, {"id": "rythme", "start": 20.43, "end": 24.83, "text": "Ensuite, coupe tous les silences, et change d'image toutes les deux ou trois secondes."}, {"id": "retiens", "start": 25.01, "end": 30.35, "text": "Retiens quatre mots : accroche, rythme, sous-titres, et une fin qui relance."}, {"id": "cta", "start": 30.63, "end": 34.27, "text": "Dis-moi en commentaire laquelle des trois ouvertures tu testes en premier."}], "words": [{"w": "Ta", "a": 0.35, "b": 0.51, "seg": "hook"}, {"w": "vidéo", "a": 0.563, "b": 0.83, "seg": "hook"}, {"w": "a", "a": 0.91, "b": 0.99, "seg": "hook"}, {"w": "trois", "a": 1.017, "b": 1.15, "seg": "hook"}, {"w": "secondes", "a": 1.207, "b": 1.63, "seg": "hook"}, {"w": "pour", "a": 1.662, "b": 1.79, "seg": "hook"}, {"w": "survivre.", "a": 1.859, "b": 2.83, "seg": "hook"}, {"w": "Après,", "a": 2.89, "b": 3.55, "seg": "algo"}, {"w": "l'algorithme", "a": 3.59, "b": 4.11, "seg": "algo"}, {"w": "regarde", "a": 4.15, "b": 4.59, "seg": "algo"}, {"w": "une", "a": 4.65, "b": 4.83, "seg": "algo"}, {"w": "seule", "a": 4.857, "b": 4.99, "seg": "algo"}, {"w": "chose", "a": 5.043, "b": 5.31, "seg": "algo"}, {"w": ":", "a": 5.59, "b": 5.87, "seg": "algo"}, {"w": "est-ce", "a": 5.89, "b": 6.03, "seg": "algo"}, {"w": "que", "a": 6.05, "b": 6.11, "seg": "algo"}, {"w": "les", "a": 6.13, "b": 6.19, "seg": "algo"}, {"w": "gens", "a": 6.238, "b": 6.43, "seg": "algo"}, {"w": "restent,", "a": 6.